  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (B): Under IRC Section 351(a), nonrecognition applies only when transferors of ''property'' control (80% or more under Section 368(c)) the corporation immediately after the exchange. Services are excluded from ''property'' under Section 351(d)(1). Partner B''s 30% is excluded from the control test, leaving A (60%) and C (10%) with only 70% — below the 80% threshold. Section 351 fails for all participants.
